師だが、表に出ることは少ない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9023","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“魔術師ギルド” の研究員にして相談役。 新たな魔術的知識の発見にすべてを費やす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性欲旺盛で、いつも自分の使い魔を使って性欲処理しているものの、いまだ処女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国内でも屈指の実力を持つ魔術師だが、表に出ることは少ない。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15373"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/7503b6a756751dfe80d3e037dffb67550d7ccc2a0569f67608f5e70566d61ac7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ed/ed269f9ab54900193f3734ab4e78a452b0e670ceb01e40f16e9d7987bf7c3e65.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高城みつ","creatorId":"vndb:s29","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s29","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s29","name":"高城 みつ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15373:6469:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5372","characterName":"オリビア＝エルロイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15374","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9024"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5372"},"originalCharacterName":"オリビア＝エルロイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The head priestess leading the convent of the church headquarters. Olivia is the admired leader of the kingdom's priestesses, earning her the nickname of 'Goddess'. She is deeply concerned about the spreading violence arising from the kingdom's war with Astaroth and has gathered the kingdom's priestesses into providing aid and relief to the fighters and victims of the war."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5372"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会本部の修道院を取り仕切る司祭長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国にいるすべての修道女たちを束ねる立場にあり、憧れの存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の女王による魔王討伐命令は、正しいことだと理解しつつも戦乱が広がることに心を痛めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直接は討伐に赴かないものの、修道女たちによる救護団を組織して後方支援に当たっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9024","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"教会本部の修道院を取り仕切る司祭長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国にいるすべての修道女たちを束ねる立場にあり、憧れの存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"今回の女王による魔王討伐命令は正しいことだと理解しつつも、戦乱が広がることに心を痛めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"直接は討伐に赴かないものの、修道女たちによる救護団を組織して後方支援に当たっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15374"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53f5e5ec0cca7d9b0e3bfe1a6a4b68c63ee21c7f1243035bc33db135abd58254.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f82d31ed6de8dfe67eac2e3c69211b4e75bfcad1a0da796d77d48d45513517e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"MARIO","creatorId":"vndb:s632","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s632","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s632","name":"紫苑 みやび","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15374:4918:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5373","characterName":"アーウィン＝シルバームーン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["9025"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5373"},"originalCharacterName":"アーウィン＝シルバームーン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Arwin is a young elf from the elven forests. Since she was born she has never ventured beyond the forest, but has been chosen to venture out and aid the battle against Astaroth after his release poses a threat to the forest and her people. Arwin fights with the aid of nature spirits."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5373"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エルフの大森林を守護する一族。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王討伐という一族の使命は十分理解していて、全うしようという意志はあるものの、自分がまだ未熟である ことも分かっており、自信が持てないでいるが、森の平和を脅かす魔王を討伐するために森を出る。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9025","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/073f280e5202774cb39e07d085d908c00de6963957be6f461a9050e6f6d8a30e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccac6be74f3a6d4b14834f23cf8fd964bacc685208c5359a4f1719b86979d5e5.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐倉 もも花","creatorId":"vndb:s267","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s267","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s267","name":"石原 愛依梨","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45742","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5374","characterName":"オボロ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15376","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9026"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5374"},"originalCharacterName":"オボロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A kunoichi. Trained as an assassin since she was young, Oboro was abandoned by the assassin organization she belonged to and was bought by the Queen, whom she is now serving. Called a \"dog\" by those around her, Oboro does not express much emotion or talk any more than is necessary."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5374"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から暗殺者として育てられ、現在では王国一の腕を持つクノイチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text"