litarily reinforcement, her secret motive is to find her lost sister Yuki, whom she believes is the kunoichi Oboro."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5375"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ストムガルト王国と国境を接する、東方国家から派遣された退魔師一族の姫君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"西方には無い、呪符と地脈を用いた退魔術を会得している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王討伐に協力する名目で入国したが、実は過去に誘拐された『ユキ』という名の姉（オボロ）を捜す、という目的も秘めている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9027","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ストムガルト王国と国境を接する、東方国家から派遣された退魔師一族の姫君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"西方には無い、呪符と地脈を用いた退魔術を会得している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔王討伐に協力する名目で入国したが、実は過去に誘拐された “ユキ” という名の姉を捜す、という目的も秘めている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15377"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38e1528827e229092a60aaf1026fef802f618d754e6062fab54c75ba6e723243.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/75/75f0cec04cf67908804c04ddaeab45bd31abc2998c9a6fb9edf65af59cdcb337.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"春日アン","creatorId":"vndb:s638","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s638","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s638","name":"春日アン(春乃うらら)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15377:6480:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5376","characterName":"マイア＝フレスト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15378","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9028"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5376"},"originalCharacterName":"マイア＝フレスト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Self styled 'hero' on a quest to defeat Astaroth, Mya is a good natured but gullible country girl from a poor village in the north. Growing up in the mountains has granted her great physical finesse, but her fencing skills are self taught and below par."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5376"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国の北方辺境に位置する寒村の出身。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称・勇者の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から山あいの地で育ったおかげか、足腰が強く身のこなしは意外と素早いが、剣術は我流のため弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根本的にお人好しで人を疑わず騙されやすい善良な田舎娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9028","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"王国の北方辺境に位置する寒村の出身。 自称・勇者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から山間の地で育ったおかげか、足腰が強く身のこなしは意外と素早いが、剣術は我流のため弱い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"根本的にお人好しで騙されやすい善良な田舎娘。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15378"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c6/c64ae00e6fc222922ca1385aa1fa4c7e29015e90e60a932ac7c603d0deb3067f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/494e15661db81287cd4346926f6ebe83318178581b999654e5695eb2a651286f.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"橘志穂","creatorId":"vndb:s738","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s738","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s738","name":"橘 志穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15378:7169:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5377","characterName":"ヴァネッサ＝クロムウェル","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15379","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9029"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5377"},"originalCharacterName":"ヴァネッサ＝クロムウェル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Queen's most trusted confidant and the commander of the Royal Guards. Nicknamed the 'Golden Goddess of War', Vanessa is the kingdom's most skilled wielder of lances and her fame is wide reaching. Abandoning her feminine side, Vanessa has chose to give her everything to martial affairs. Along with the Queen, Vanessa is a descendant from the heroes who sealed Astaroth 200 years ago."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5377"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女王ダリアンからは全幅の信頼を得ている女王を守護する近衛隊の隊長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『黄金の武神』の異名を持つ王国最強の槍の使い手であり、その名は大陸全土に轟いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女としての自分を捨て、人生の全てを槍術の向上に充てている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9029","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"女王ダリアンからは全幅の信頼を得ている、女王を守護する近衛隊の隊長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“黄金の武神” の異名を持つ王国最強の槍の使い手であり、その名は大陸全土に轟いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女としての自分を捨て、人生の全てを槍術の向上に充てている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15379"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/55c472fddad2f19fb8353cce59b8b367631da4e7ffe2c2fc1a0fc15c720a965f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6cc271300fb61ede511cc12fdce842dfeb23c0a02f8dce98f1e8713823e7c0fe.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"浅井晴美","creatorId":"vndb:s518","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s518","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s518","name":"浅井 晴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15379:6131:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5378","characterName":"ジリオラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15380","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9030"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5378"},"originalCharacterName":"ジリオラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Astaroth's servant. Zilliola has served the demon king before he was sealed and has worked to release him. As a demon she does not possess much power, but behind her calm disposition is a skilled tactician."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5378"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が封印される以前から側近を務め、封印されたのちも忠誠を誓って復活の手助けをした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9030","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が封印される以前から側近を務め、封印された後も忠誠を誓って復活の手助けをした"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15380"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/48/489a3fa084c6c2ee55ee04e806fc425c63cd6effffb3959577a3743b3bcfae7a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/473c57f23d939b07561f65c4868a0455d4ab640a001976526078c022774dbed6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本井えみ","creatorId":"vndb:s124","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s124","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s124","name":"本井 えみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15380:4177:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5379","characterName":"ミスカ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"15381","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"37663"}],"egsCharacterIds":["9031"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5379"},"originalCharacterName":"ミスカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Astaroth's servant. Compared to Jilliola, Miska has a bright elder sister personality. Although she treats demonkind warmly, her hatred of humans are not inferior to Jilliola's, and if it wasn't for Astaroth she would be happily torturing the captured heroines."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5379"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が封印される以前から側近を務め、封印されたのちも忠誠を誓って復活の手助けをした。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9031","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が封印される以前から側近を務め、封印された後も忠誠を誓って復活の手助けをした。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"15381"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d964a580a11236c1826663963450a361b30917954abc3dd28fd0cabfda6d7b9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10cf31ef7f729788506c7158a8fb6242cfbe3d0fe88fd42af79de9ef501a5108.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"壱智村小真","creatorId":"vndb:s364","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s364","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s364","name":"壱智村 小真","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:37663:15381:4830:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c5380","characterName":"ダリアン＝ストムガルト","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["9033"],"vndbCharacterId":"c5380"},"originalCharacterName":"ダリアン＝ストムガルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Queen of Stomgard Kingdom. Darian is officially descended from the heroes who sealed Astaroth 200 years ago. She is a cunning ruler but her high handed ways has earned her dissatisfaction among her ministers."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Depending on the route players take, she is eventually unmasked as an imposter when Hymns obtains secret documentation revealing the palace coup which dethroned and killed the monarch of Stromgard several generations before her reign."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5380"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"かつて魔族軍と戦い、魔王を地下へと封印した勇者の末裔の１人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"辺境民族に圧政を敷き、その反発をさらに武力で抑え込む政治を行う暴君。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"横暴ではあるが暗愚ではなく、むしろ巧みに国民の不満を逸らすことに長けている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"9033","sourceWorkId":"16604","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2be61601db6bbf08c3ccfed1b4a0cc38f081590df57f235de59a417d66799738.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffe32a9fec6a7cb7e93b91b4d3e1d46caebc32dff987b2d4c2531ea381c15658.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"この かなみ","creatorId":"vndb:s656","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s656","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s656","name":"加藤 雅美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45748","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5370","characterName":"ジュリアン＝バルクラフト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5370"},"originalCharacterName":"ジュリアン＝バルクラフト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A wandering adventurer and warrior. Born in the slums and raised in poverty. Julian has formed parties with other adventurers in the past, but after experiencing falling out with past party members numerous times, she now prefers to adventure alone. After hearing the Queen's proclamation to subjugate Astaroth, Julian join the cause but adventures alone into Astaroth's labyrinth."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5370"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f0/f0b2ecd1ac8774ba8a05d0f6526b28d09f9e9f234eae35180bba993e07bce93e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4bcdd47a93320d3198c639b4eba7c2d41942dc18c3743463a7d94966db82b970.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"楠田 兎","creatorId":"vndb:s279","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s279","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s279","name":"小林 眞紀","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45750","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c5381","characterName":"ヒムス＝ローガナ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c5381"},"originalCharacterName":"ヒムス＝ローガナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The prime minister of Stomgard Kingdom. An ex-paladin of the church, Hymns has risen to the top of politics through underhanded maneuverings and his desire for power has led him to aim for the throne."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5381"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/49c42c9c3ee987ebbbfa12d76b1df648b2efbfee699fb7d26ef21a63cb89de00.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d554c0e23e3c93cf6af6f9f26ec8c5ace870edbff0ae8e7b7f81dc240881f8f9.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"広野 大地","creatorId":"vndb:s37","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37","name":"鈴木 貴征","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-